  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AfDB Fin Sys support - MFW4A Secondment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AfDB Fin Sys support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A support package to improve AfDB capacity for coordination, networking and knowledge management among donors and local financial sector stakeholders in Africa. The main component consists of a financial contribution to the MFW4A secretariat hosted within AfDB. Two additional components involve two secondments, both were however cancelled.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett st&#xF6;dpaket f&#xF6;r att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra AfDB kapacitet f&#xF6;r koordinering, n&#xE4;tverkande och &quot;knowledge management&quot; bland givare och den lokala finansiella sektorns akt&#xF6;rer i Afrika. Den st&#xF6;rsta komponenten best&#xE5;r av ett finansiellt bidrag till MFW4A:s sekretariat hos AfDB. Ytterligare tv&#xE5; komponenter r&#xF6;r tv&#xE5; sekunderingar, b&#xE5;da blev dock inst&#xE4;llda.</narrative>
  </description>
